# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in the values.
# `.env` is gitignored; `.env.example` is committed.

# --- Cloudflare account -----------------------------------------------------
# Wrangler needs an explicit account id when more than one Cloudflare account
# is authenticated on the machine.
#
#   npx wrangler whoami
#
CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID=

# --- Admin access -----------------------------------------------------------
#
# There is deliberately NO gate on /admin. The Cloudflare Access guard that used
# to live in middleware.ts was removed in commit 71711ba, and nothing replaced
# it: every route, including members' names and phone numbers, is reachable by
# anyone who has the URL. Keep this deployment local or private until a gate is
# put back.

# --- WhatsApp (module 8+) --------------------------------------------------
# NEVER commit these. For production use `wrangler secret put <NAME>`.
#
# META_WHATSAPP_TOKEN=
# META_PHONE_NUMBER_ID=
# CRON_SECRET=
